    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000qkg7](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000qkg7) Magnitude 5.6 earthquake at 53.485 depth occurred on Jun 15 2025 13km SW of Callao Island. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -12.1473 longitude -77.3152. It impacted 8717837 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
